    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s3_ev_t",
      "x": 1468,
      "y": 976,
      "width": 590,
      "height": 156,
      "text": "REAL \u2014 gate 3 firing, clean replay cycle 18\n\ncoder failed: Label leakage in features.py:\n  line 86: reads 'is_click', a feedback/label\n  column \u2014 it is an outcome of the same\n  impression being ranked and cannot be a\n  model input\n\n\u2192 3 leak attempts caught, 0 reached a run",
      "originalText": "REAL \u2014 gate 3 firing, clean replay cycle 18\n\ncoder failed: Label leakage in features.py:\n  line 86: reads 'is_click', a feedback/label\n  column \u2014 it is an outcome of the same\n  impression being ranked and cannot be a\n  model input\n\n\u2192 3 leak attempts caught, 0 reached a run",
