    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s4_frozen_l",
      "x": 84,
      "y": 1388,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "official/          vendored Starter Kit\n  evaluate.py      sole scoring authority\n  data.py          official row order\n  submit.py        submission schema\n\nsolution/\n  dataset.py       loads all 20 columns\n  scoring.py       the ONLY metric doorway\n  runner.py        fixed wiring\n  leakcheck.py     the AST gate",
      "originalText": "official/          vendored Starter Kit\n  evaluate.py      sole scoring authority\n  data.py          official row order\n  submit.py        submission schema\n\nsolution/\n  dataset.py       loads all 20 columns\n  scoring.py       the ONLY metric doorway\n  runner.py        fixed wiring\n  leakcheck.py     the AST gate",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 400114,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 400115,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": null,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.45
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s4_frozen_why",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 1388,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "WHY:\n\n\u00b7 the agent cannot redefine the metric\n  it is judged on\n\n\u00b7 a bad edit breaks ONE module,\n  never the harness\n\n\u00b7 row order is asserted against the\n  official loader \u2014 submission ids\n  stay valid\n\n\u00b7 feedback columns are unreachable\n  from feature code by construction",
      "originalText": "WHY:\n\n\u00b7 the agent cannot redefine the metric\n  it is judged on\n\n\u00b7 a bad edit breaks ONE module,\n  never the harness\n\n\u00b7 row order is asserted against the\n  official loader \u2014 submission ids\n  stay valid\n\n\u00b7 feedback columns are unreachable\n  from feature code by construction",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
