    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s4_edit_l",
      "x": 1024,
      "y": 1388,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "solution/features.py   what the model sees\nsolution/model.py      the scoring function\nsolution/train.py      objective + optimiser\n\nRewritten wholesale each cycle. Interfaces\nfixed, internals free. The contract:\n\n  Encoded(X, y, user_id, aux, video_id)\n  FM.grad(X, dz) -> (gV, gW, gb)\n  loss(model, X, y[, user_id]) -> (dz, loss)\n\naux holds is_click, play_time_ms ... as\nTARGETS. Attached by the frozen runner, so\nfeature code cannot reach them at all.",
      "originalText": "solution/features.py   what the model sees\nsolution/model.py      the scoring function\nsolution/train.py      objective + optimiser\n\nRewritten wholesale each cycle. Interfaces\nfixed, internals free. The contract:\n\n  Encoded(X, y, user_id, aux, video_id)\n  FM.grad(X, dz) -> (gV, gW, gb)\n  loss(model, X, y[, user_id]) -> (dz, loss)\n\naux holds is_click, play_time_ms ... as\nTARGETS. Attached by the frozen runner, so\nfeature code cannot reach them at all.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
